.TH CINNAMON-SCREENSAVER-VIDEO-PREVIEW 1 "2026" "cinnamon-screensaver-video 0.9.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cinnamon-screensaver-video-preview \- preview the Cinnamon screensaver video background
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cinnamon-screensaver-video-preview
.RI [ FILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Plays the video configured for the Cinnamon screensaver and lock screen full
screen on the primary monitor, using the same scaling, darkening and sound
settings as the lock screen. If
.I FILE
is given, that local video file is played instead of the configured one.
.PP
Press
.B Esc
or
.BR q ,
or click, to close the preview.
.PP
The video itself is configured in System Settings, on the
.B Video
tab of the Screensaver page, or with
.BR gsettings (1)
under the schema
.BR org.cinnamon.screensaver-video .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The preview was closed normally.
.TP
.B 1
No usable video was configured or given, or no display is available.
.TP
.B 2
The video could not be played.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/cinnamon-screensaver-video/log
Messages about why a video was or wasn't played, and playback errors.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cinnamon-screensaver (1),
.BR cinnamon-screensaver-command (1),
.BR gsettings (1)
